# Electronics

The Retrocade uses a Raspberry Pi 4 running RetroPie as the main computing system. The electronics connect the physical arcade controls to the games while providing video output through a monitor.

## Main Components

| Component | Purpose |
|---|---|
| Raspberry Pi 4 | Main computer |
| RetroPie | Arcade emulation system |
| Arcade joysticks | Player movement/input |
| Push buttons | Game controls |
| Encoder boards | Convert arcade controls into USB inputs |
| 19" monitor | Game display |
| HDMI cable | Video connection |
| Power supply | Powers the system |

## System Architecture


                    Raspberry Pi 4
                         │
                     RetroPie
                         │
          ┌──────────────┼──────────────┐
          │              │              │
          ▼              ▼              ▼
     Player 1        Player 2        Monitor
      Controls        Controls        (HDMI)
          │              │
          ▼              ▼
      Joystick +      Joystick +
       Buttons         Buttons
          │              │
          └────── Encoder Boards ──────┘
